    "traits": "Consumable Herb",
    "description": "<strong>Usage held in 1 hand; Activate Interact (2 AP).</strong>\n\nTerrain: temperate ruins, monastery gardens or cultivated ground.\n\nMindseed grows within pale, lantern-shaped pods that rattle softly when ripe. Each pod contains a handful of perfectly round black seeds marked by a thin silver seam. Scribes toast the seeds until the seam opens, then swallow them with warm water to produce a state of alert concentration and unusually ordered thought. For 1 hour, you gain a +2-item bonus to Recall Knowledge checks.\n\nPillars of Faith, Chapter 6.",
